@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName DejaVu Sans
[*] --> Requested : user selects Pay Interest
Requested --> Validating : check customer and account
Validating --> Rejected : invalid owner / cheque account
Validating --> CheckingMonth : savings or investment
CheckingMonth --> Rejected : month already posted
CheckingMonth --> Calculating : reserve account-month marker
Calculating --> Saving : calculate and round thebe
Saving --> Posted : update balance and history; COMMIT
Saving --> RolledBack : database error; ROLLBACK
Rejected --> [*]
Posted --> [*]
RolledBack --> [*]
@enduml
